23
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:47,269
A point

24
00:00:47,871 --> 00:00:50,351
a, f of a, is a global maximum

25
00:00:50,672 --> 00:00:52,352
if f of x is less than or

26
00:00:52,493 --> 00:00:54,773
equal to f of a, for every x

27
00:00:54,955 --> 00:00:55,514
in the domain.

28
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:58,552
Picture a horizontal line at that height.

29
00:00:59,156 --> 00:01:01,123
For a global maximum, no part of the

30
00:01:01,164 --> 00:01:02,107
