78
00:02:48,045 --> 00:02:49,987
On the coaster, the highest point of this

79
00:02:50,028 --> 00:02:51,870
stretch is the top of the climb, not

80
00:02:51,911 --> 00:02:54,374
the hump, and the lowest point comes twice,

81
00:02:54,755 --> 00:02:56,317
